{"id":"wb-7-1081","name":"林公忠平王祖殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"林公忠平王祖殿","text":"林公忠平王祖殿，又名林公宫，位于中国福建省宁德市周宁县玛坑乡杉洋村，始建于明朝正德八年（1513年），主祀林公忠平王林祖亘。林公忠平王祖殿于2005年5月入选福建省文物保护单位，2013年3月入选全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9E%97%E5%85%AC%E5%BF%A0%E5%B9%B3%E7%8E%8B%E7%A5%96%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":85836187,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85836187","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cf2f6961abc852cf85237e6f.jpg","title":"Shrine_of_Lin_Zuxuan.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shrine_of_Lin_Zuxuan.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Shrine_of_Lin_Zuxuan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Allervous","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Shrine of Lin Zuxuan, in Zhouning county.","width":320,"height":192}}